	(text "Here SHDN_TO_TSMS goes out \nthrough the ampseal to the TSMS, \nthe last node in the shutdown circuit.\n\nFINAL_SHDN comes in through the \nampseal after TSMS and is also called\nSHDN_SENSE_TSMS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 309.88 162.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
